{"id":"C1254a5657d0289451ece","zh":"随机分析","en":"random analysis","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","definition_zh":"在系统参数或激励具有随机性的条件下研究系统响应及其统计特征。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C1254a5657d0289451ece","zh":"随机分析","en":"random analysis","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"H1eee13c5a54fb142afd3","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D4425275b15fde7e5954e","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"随机分析"},{"id":"D50db1ec2abbc1ae752b9","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"random analysis"}],"sources":{"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"},"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S9ac26790173c566864d6","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"依据车辆-轨道耦合动力学和随机分析理论,建立了用于横风、轨道随机不平顺联合分析的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sb0e1d9cb8d03083aa031","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"在本文给出的计算条件下,当横风标准风速达到15m/s以上时,会逐步影响车辆的平稳舒适性,而当风速达到25m/s以上,行车安全受到严重威胁;此模型能够用于风环境下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析及可靠度计算。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sace76ddf877e666caf36","source_id":"P112","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于随机分析理论,考虑线路不平顺及系统动力参数的时-空随机演变特性,将车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论与概率密度演化方法结合,提出一种用于线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sfe2e9b462cefa196ec61","source_id":"P112","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于随机分析的一般理论,考虑线路不平顺的空间随机性和长时效演变性,以及轨道结构动力参数的随机性,将车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论 [3]与概率密度演化方法 [4]结合,提出一种用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C034bc5de8ea2b7d4eec0","target_concept_id":"C034bc5de8ea2b7d4eec0","target_zh":"概率密度演化方法","target_en":"probability density evolution method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_concept_id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","target_en":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_concept_id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_zh":"轨道随机不平顺","target_en":"track random irregularities","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C523f6ff1ae79366974fe","target_concept_id":"C523f6ff1ae79366974fe","target_zh":"标准风速","target_en":"reference wind velocity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_concept_id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_zh":"基础结构","target_en":"railway infrastructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cadf72024a0868b8fced7","target_concept_id":"Cadf72024a0868b8fced7","target_zh":"伤损识别","target_en":"damage detection","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"},{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-me